mitted. If you are not the intended recipient, please destroy all copies and=
 inform the sender by return e-mail. Internet e-mail is not a secure medium.=
 Any reply to this message could be intercepted and read by someone else. Pl=
ease bear that in mind when deciding whether to send material in response to=
 this message by e-mail. This e-mail (whether you are the sender or the reci=
pient) may be monitored, recorded and retained by the Ministry of Justice. M=
onitoring / blocking software may be used, and e-mail content may be read at=
 any time. You have a responsibility to ensure laws are not broken when comp=
osing or forwarding e-mails and their contents. 

